# Figma API Configuration
# Get your personal access token from: https://www.figma.com/developers/api#access-tokens
#
# How to generate a Figma Access Token:
# 1. Go to Figma Settings (click your profile icon -> Settings)
# 2. Scroll down to "Personal access tokens"
# 3. Click "Create new token"
# 4. Give it a descriptive name
# 5. Copy the token and paste it below
#
# Note: Tokens are scoped to your account and grant read access to files you can view

FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=figd_your_access_token_here
